  "narrative": "The analysis compared the average stake per bet for five gambling products across four time\u2011of\u2011day bands: morning, afternoon, evening and late\u2011night.  \n\n- Sports betting: late\u2011night mean stake\u202f=\u202f31.0, which exceeds the evening (19.97), afternoon (19.45) and morning (19.42) means.  \n- Casino games: late\u2011night mean stake\u202f=\u202f52.8, higher than evening (31.59), afternoon (32.29) and morning (33.46).  \n- Slot machines: late\u2011night mean stake\u202f=\u202f67.93, greater than evening (26.4), afternoon (28.88) and morning (27.89).  \n- Lottery: late\u2011night mean stake\u202f=\u202f10.56, above evening (7.7), afternoon (7.58) and morning (7.27).  \n- Bingo: late\u2011night mean stake\u202f=\u202f19.26, larger than evening (11.63), afternoon (11.53) and morning (12.42).  \n\nFor every product, the late\u2011night hour band shows a higher average stake per bet than all other bands, supporting the claim that all gambling products exhibit a late\u2011night effect on stake size. No other comparisons were made, and no estimates were required beyond the released figures.",
